Package: revdeprunner
Type: Package
Title: Reusable Reverse-Dependency Check Infrastructure
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("James", "Melville", email = "jlmelville@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Internal infrastructure for reproducible, incremental R package
    reverse-dependency checks. It will manage immutable binary artifacts,
    isolated writable state, exact dependency manifests, and guarded adapters
    around reverse-dependency comparison tools.
